sections.text:
Stiffness and sharp erratic pains ;
worse in joints. Feet itch. Numbness in left arm.
Rheumatic pain in clavicles. Shooting in all limbs.

Worse, damp air, lying on left side ; in
morning on first rising. Better, dry weather, motion;
intermenstrual flow. [Ham.; Bovista; Bell.; Elaps.]
